      "id": "P4.4-DatabaseSource-dynamicPermissions",
      "title": "P4.4 — DatabaseSource: назначения, сроки, dynamicPermissions, писатель",
      "text": "**Intent:** Создать DatabaseSource raw scoped reads, builder, SPI fence/selection с witnesses и Storage::own. Dynamic overlay/Prepare — P4.17, scoped end-to-end/P08 — P4.18 после boundary/eligibility.\n**Why:** RAG:— 05 §4.1 (`DatabaseSource`, builder-методы), 06 §1.1 (capabilities, `FiltersQueries`), §1.2 (правила выдач, dynamic требует TenantRef), 08 §2 (схема, ключи, индексы), 09 §8 «Чтение DB authority», §16 (StateToken только при потреблённом DatabaseSource), 19 §3, §5; 20 §2 «Read state», F05/F09/F10; D13, D24, D46, D52, D62, D64, D68, D80 досье; V54, V74, V82, V91, V92; probe P08; D12 п.4/п.8, D13, D14 п.3, п.6, п.7 плана.\n**Scope Included:** DatabaseSource capabilities и builder make/rolesOnly/dynamicPermissions/storage/models/decisionFields по 05 §4.1. FencesReads/FiltersQueries/AssignmentScopeSelection с точными сигнатурами D15 §4–§5. Raw scoped reads, local fence 3 попытки, Storage::own/public поверхность. Dynamic flag определяется здесь, runtime overlay реализован P4.17 до dynamic use. Scoped Authorizer Allow пока не обещается.\n**Scope Excluded:** Dynamic overlay — P4.17; scoped Authorizer/P08 — P4.18; запись/apply/dynamic create/delete — P5.2/P5.3; cache — P4.8; transaction protocol — P4.20; visibility — P4.12; doctor — P6.4.\n**Inputs:** `@plan/decisions/D16.json` · `@plan/plan.json` · `@plan/phases/P4/phase.json` · `@plan/decisions/D14.json` · `@plan/decisions/D15.json` · `@plan/brief.json` · `@plan/brief.json`\n**Files:** `packages/core/src/Sources/Database/DatabaseSource.php` · `packages/core/src/Contracts/Sources/{FencesReads,FiltersQueries,AssignmentScopeSelection}.php` · `packages/core/src/Storage/{Storage,StorageRegistry}.php` · `packages/core/src/Authorization/Pipeline/Stages/AuthorityStage.php` · `packages/core/src/Sources/SourceManager.php` · `packages/core/api-manifest.json` · `tests/Feature/Sources/Database/{DatabaseReadsTest,DatabaseBuilderTest,DecisionFieldsTest,FenceTest,StorageOwnTest,SelectionWitnessTest}.php` · `tests/Engines/DatabaseSourceEngineTest.php` · `tests/Fixtures/Sources/Database/**` · `CHANGELOG.md`.\n**Required Reads:** 1) `audits/2026-09-29-audit/opus/09-authorization-semantics.md` 2) `audits/2026-09-29-audit/opus/06-extension-points.md` 3) `audits/2026-09-29-audit/opus/08-data-model-and-migration.md` 4) `audits/2026-09-29-audit/opus/14-verification.md` 5) `packages/core/src/Contracts/Authorization/EvaluationContext.php` 6) `packages/core/src/Catalog/PanelCatalog.php` 7) `packages/core/src/Catalog/RoleCompiler.php` 8) `packages/core/src/Panels/PanelBuilder.php` 9) `packages/core/src/Storage/Storage.php` 10) `packages/core/src/Storage/StorageRegistry.php` 11) `packages/core/src/Storage/GrantFields.php` 12) `@plan/decisions/D15.json` 13) `@plan/brief.json`\n**Implementation Rules:** SQL panel/exact subject identity + OR точных (tenant,context) пар, не независимые IN. Scalar ≤1 role_grants+1 permission_grants query. Identity HostKeyColumns/IdentityCodec, fields только GrantFields decisionValues; malformed id → SourceError. Роли разворачивает core. rolesOnly не читает permission_grants. Primary write PDO для state/grants, Default отдельный pinned read-only PDO route без sticky/write fallback, не Storage::table()/state() с useWritePdo; transaction/read mode guard только при consumed fenced source; весь fence на одном handle. Нынешний Storage::state использует table()->useWritePdo (Storage.php:83–85,143); P4.4 добавляет pinned Default helper и transaction guard: writePDO внутри old snapshot не fresh. T_before → capabilities → T_after: discard whole set/retry ≤3; PolicyOnly 0 assignment/state/dynamic reads. FiltersQueries contextsCovering возвращает raw witnesses tenant/type; Selection everywhere(contributions)/in(refs,contributions)/nowhere/contributions() по D15 §5, refs candidate superset, не Allow. Storage::own: own-+substr(hash(sha256, IdentityCodec::compose([resolved connection,prefix])),0,60), повтор пары hostKeys match, два prefix одного connection не коллизия. StoresGrants::transaction делегирует mutate, apply P5.2. Models validated. Arch allowlist D15 §7.\n**Code Guidance:** Raw grants/roleGrants тестируются с explicit exact AccessScope непосредственно, не через scoped Authorizer до P4.6. Engine binary keys/trailing spaces/>2038/fields/read mode/rolesOnly, state retries, selection multiple witnesses одной scope. Own reuse/hostKeys mismatch/same connection two prefixes. Scoped V74/V91/P08 — P4.18, dynamic V82/V92 — P4.17/P4.18, real race — P4.21.\n**Validation:** 1) `vendor/bin/pest tests/Feature/Sources/Database tests/Regression/RegressionSpecsTest.php` — GREEN; 2) `docker compose up -d --wait postgres mysql mariadb`; 3) `DB_CONNECTION=pgsql php -d memory_limit=1G vendor/bin/pest --group=engines --fail-on-skipped` — GREEN; 4) `DB_CONNECTION=mysql php -d memory_limit=1G vendor/bin/pest --group=engines --fail-on-skipped` — GREEN; 5) `DB_CONNECTION=mariadb php -d memory_limit=1G vendor/bin/pest --group=engines --fail-on-skipped` — GREEN; 6) `vendor/bin/pest tests/Arch` — GREEN; 7) `php bin/api-manifest.php --check` — exit 0 после `composer api:manifest`; 8) `composer test`; 9) `vendor/bin/pint --test`; 10) `vendor/bin/phpstan analyse --memory-limit=1G`; 11) `php -d memory_limit=1G vendor/bin/pest --type-coverage --min=98`; 12) `git diff --check`.\n**Deliverables:** Raw source/fence/SPI/selection/Storage::own и engines evidence findings/P4-execution.md. P08 planned до owning P4.18; full dynamic/scoped acceptance внутри P4.17/P4.18, не P5."
    },
